 at least once (Delivery guarantee). Message offsets that help consumers (The Backend Spring Boot Application here) track the point till which messages have been consumed from the Kafka queue.   Deployment of the messaging application with the Kafka broker to the cloud (AWS) where replicated instances are maintained which are served with Elastic Load Balancers to forward requests fairly. ","topics":[],"score":200178,"global_rank":308775},{"name":"chrisarevir/game-of-jeffpardy","owner":"chrisarevir","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisarevir/game-of-jeffpardy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":15,"language":"JavaScript","description":"It answers","topics":[],"score":200178,"global_rank":308777},{"name":"wwatson/land-bridge-client","owner":"wwatson","html_url":"https://github.com/wwatson/land-bridge-client","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":200164,"global_rank":308789},{"name":"bgorwin/gridGalleryReact","owner":"bgorwin","html_url":"https://github.com/bgorwin/gridGalleryReact","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":17,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":200164,"global_rank":308790},{"name":"andrewbastian/node-api1","owner":"andrewbastian","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewbastian/node-api1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":11,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":200164,"global_rank":308791},{"name":"passionfruition/Get-The-Scoop","owner":"passionfruition","html_url":"https://github.com/passionfruition/Get-The-Scoop","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":7,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":200164,"global_rank":308794},{"name":"Danimal92/jeopardy-frontend","owner":"Danimal92","html_url":"https://github.com/Danimal92/jeopardy-frontend","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":22,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Frontend portion of Jeopardy App, made with React","topics":[],"score":2001